  "title": "Developmentalism, State-Led Industrialization and Divergent Outcomes",
  "summary": "Developmentalism linked economic growth, industrial capacity and state-building, while state-led industrialization concentrated capital, industry and infrastructure around long-term transformation goals. Similar instruments nevertheless produced different outcomes across societies.",
